# Ralph workflow scratch — per-PR commit messages and PR body templates that
# live as files just so git-workflow can pass them via `-F` / `--body-file`.
# The permanent record is the commit message and PR description, not these.
plans/github-issues/COMMIT_*.md
plans/github-issues/PR_*.md
